{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01219","headline":"相和歌辞  苦寒行 · 僧贯休","name":"相和歌辞  苦寒行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北风北风，职何严毒。\n摧壮士心，缩金乌足。\n冻云嚣嚣碍雪，一片下不得。\n声绕枯桑，根在沙塞。\n黄河彻底，顽直到海。\n一气搏束，万物无态。\n唯有吾庭前杉松树枝，枝枝健在。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}